#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:37
#: a5764797f15c44679a24012fd40dda79
msgid "A Reach unit mounted on the vehicle can receive base corrections over telemetry radio, thus not requiring a separate correction link to the drone. Coordinate output is implemented via a serial port."
msgstr ""

